WEBVTT

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:03.940
"#13 'Our Own Shine'"

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.590
My school uniform today feels like new!

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:12.820
I used heavy starch.

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:13.950
Thanks!

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:16.990
Button all the way up!

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:18.620
It's tight!

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:22.620
Oh? Chika, since I last saw you, have you...

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:23.370
Hm?

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:27.990
...gained weight?

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:31.710
Jeez...! You don't have to
say things like that!

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:35.180
Riko-<i>chan</i>...! That dog...

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:40.510
Morning! This is our new family member,
Prelude. Say hi, Prelude.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.060
--Err...
--Although I didn't do
too well with dogs before,

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:45.420
now that we have one,
I can't get over how cute Prelude is!

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.020
Good doggie.

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:48.260
I see...

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:50.900
Ah! Shiitake!

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:54.950
Shiitake-<i>chan</i> looks happy
with her new puppies.

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:58.070
When we came home from Tokyo,
the puppies were already born.

00:00:58.070 --> 00:00:59.610
That was a big surprise!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.290
Rather, I was surprised to learn
Shiitake-<i>chan</i> was a girl.

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:06.210
"Ura High"

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:08.000
Morning, aye, aye!

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.090
--Aye, aye!
--Aye, aye!

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:12.130
You do seem fired up.

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:13.710
Of course, since this is the last day.

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:17.130
--Leave Yohane alone!
--Ruby-<i>chan</i> and the others
are already here, too.

00:01:17.130 --> 00:01:19.180
Just how long are you
planning to stay there, <i>zura</i>?

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:21.390
The ceremony will start soon!

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:23.310
Just go on ahea--

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:24.850
Not again!

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:27.730
Don't look at me!

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:29.190
I wonder what happened to her...

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:33.480
Are you nervous?

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:34.860
No way.

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:39.400
Rather, I feel proud...
to be able to take part in this event.

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:40.870
"Uranohoshi Girls' High School"
"Graduation and School Closing Ceremony"

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:46.330
Wow, when you screw up,
you don't mess around, <i>zura</i>.

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:48.920
Since this is the last day,
I went all out and did my hair.

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:51.540
And then, before I knew 
it, it was like this...

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:52.840
Don't worry.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.650
Leave it to us, <i>zura</i>.

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:59.380
I'll fix it all up for you, <i>zura</i>. Chop, chop!

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:04.430
Oh, good. That's a relief... Noooooot!

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:11.170
I didn't realize that 
this room was this big...

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:14.540
We brought in lots of things here, so...

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:19.570
If we did a better job tidying things up,
we might've been able to practice here more.

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:19.570
"School Idol C̶u̶l̶b̶ Club"

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:20.780
Yeah.

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:25.080
Kanan-<i>chan</i>...

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:28.080
Everything's gone, huh?

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:31.080
That's not really true.

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:35.530
It'll remain in our hearts... forever...

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:39.800
Yep!

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:42.800
Mari-<i>san</i>.

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:45.510
What's the matter, Dia?

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:49.100
Let me tell you one thing.
No goofing around today, okay?

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.190
Behave yourself on the last day for a change.

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:53.480
Of course I will.

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:56.770
I'll be on my best behavior,
and we'll behave like our normal selves!

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:59.780
Do you really mean... that?!

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:02.950
I'll do my... Rubesty!

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:06.410
"I'll do my Rubesty"

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:06.410
Tee-hee.

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:11.210
Using every ounce of
my magical power as a fallen angel,

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:15.090
I was able to use my ultimate technique
and take my true form!

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:17.460
We just put her hair back 
to how it was, <i>zura</i>.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:19.470
"Thank you"

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:23.680
What is... going on?

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:23.680
"I'll do my Rubesty"

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:30.100
Dia-<i>chan</i>! I heard that we're
writing messages since this is the last day.

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:31.190
Writing messages?

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:33.770
Yes. I opened up the courtyard so that

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:36.070
everyone can write messages
on the school building.

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:38.080
Here. You should do it, too, sis.

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:47.910
What a mess... What're we going to do?
The ceremony commences soon.

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:52.580
But it's always been like this, right...?
Both us and this school...

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:58.060
Now looking at all this, it brings back
all sorts of memories, doesn't it?

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:01.750
We practiced together and
sometimes we goofed around, too...

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:10.760
Don't, Ruby-<i>chan</i>.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:15.550
We all promised that we wouldn't cry.

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:18.010
--Okay...
--Right.

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:20.740
We'll stay cheery with our best smiles.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:27.270
Now we're moving on
to conferring diplomas.

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:30.870
Representing the graduates, Kanan Matsuura.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:31.750
Yes.

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:38.960
It feels kinda strange receiving it from you.

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:42.460
It'll be a lifelong treasure. Cherish it.

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:45.750
Congratulations on your graduation!

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:55.810
Today, Uranohoshi Girls' High School
will end its long history.

00:04:56.480 --> 00:05:03.500
But this school
will remain in our hearts forever.

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:07.950
I feel proud to be able to walk
a new path with those memories...

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:13.290
...and to have been a student
at Uranohoshi Girls' High School.

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:17.370
I hope you'll remember it as well.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:23.760
As of this moment, we're closing...

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:26.510
Uranohoshi Girls' High School!

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:30.260
We did it!

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:32.430
We won...

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:34.200
...Love Live!

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:43.940
<i>Chasing down the path</i>
<i>of a dream I've never seen</i>

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:51.580
<i>Shining Road</i>

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:55.120
<i>This feeling of being off to the races</i>

00:05:55.120 --> 00:06:00.080
<i>I searched for you energetically,</i>
<i>straight and true</i>

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:04.210
<i>No way we can wait one second,</i>
<i>let's leap out there</i>

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:08.930
<i>The courage we have in us is clamoring</i>

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:14.430
<i>The everyday world takes new doors</i>

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:16.640
<i>(More) And hides them</i>

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:21.150
<i>(Let's go!) I want to open them all</i>

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:23.650
<i>Come on, let's do it together!</i>

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:28.320
<i>I want to start it! My story!</i>
<i>(Here, now's the time)</i>

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:32.990
<i>Blue skies are waiting</i>

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:36.040
<i>Hug that dream tight, and Jumping Heart</i>

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:42.790
<i>Just with that, I can move on to tomorrow,</i>
<i>youth full speed ahead?!</i>

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:47.760
<i>From when it began (Sunshine Story)</i>

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:52.220
<i>Cherish that thrill in our hearts always</i>

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:55.220
<i>We'll go out to catch our dreams</i>

00:06:55.220 --> 00:07:05.480
<i>Not knowing what might happen</i>
<i>is part of the fun</i>

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:10.150
Well, it's about time to go.

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:12.340
No one seems to be going home yet.

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:12.660
<i>Jumping Heart</i>

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:16.240
<i>'Cause what I want to start</i>

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:16.490
It's like they're gonna stay here
until someone tells them to go home.

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:17.370
<i>Charging Heart</i>

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:18.700
They're completely
holing up in the school, <i>zura</i>.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:21.170
<i>I've only just discovered</i>

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:22.620
Then the board might say
that it's okay to keep the school alive.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:26.090
<i>Where's the goal? Where is it? I don't know!</i>

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:25.630
If that really happens,
everyone will be really surprised.

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:30.630
--Yeah.
--Let's make sure we finish it properly.
We decided to do so ourselves.

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:31.590
<i>I don't know, but it looks like fun</i>

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.630
"Take care" "Thank you for everything"
"Thank you"

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:34.200
Ah! Amazing!

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:39.220
<i>I want to start it! My story!</i>

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:37.100
--It's so beautiful...
--Yeah, it is...

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:38.390
Right?!

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:40.890
We all drew it
from our memories of the event.

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:44.020
<i>Blue skies are waiting</i>

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:44.100
This is how you guys appeared to us then.

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:46.860
<i>Hug that dream tight, and Jumping Heart</i>

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:45.690
You were shining.

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:48.110
Yeah, so bright that it almost blinded us.

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:53.570
<i>Just with that, I can move on to tomorrow,</i>
<i>youth full speed ahead?!</i>

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:53.110
We were able to see you, too, shining...

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:58.330
<i>From when it began (Sunshine Story)</i>

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:58.160
...your lights that spread
throughout the hall...

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:03.080
<i>Cherish that thrill in our hearts always</i>

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:02.250
Then everything was shining, huh?

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:03.540
Yep!

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:06.130
<i>We'll go out to catch our dreams</i>

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:06.410
That's right. Everything was shining!

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:15.220
<i>If we're all together, then I know everything</i>
<i>will be okay, even if I can't explain why...</i>

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:12.260
Well then, I'll close it, okay?

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:21.890
This is it, <i>zura</i>.

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:24.520
Everything is gone, huh?

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:30.030
It's not that they were thrown away, <i>zura</i>.
They flew away just like birds, <i>zura</i>.

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:31.490
Like, flap, flap?

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:38.240
They'll be read by many people at a new place.
I think it's a very good thing, <i>zura</i>.

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:42.300
We're going to a new school, too.

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:44.710
I'm a little afraid, <i>zura</i>.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:46.500
Me, too.

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:52.800
But I was able to be a school idol with you
and the others. I think I'll be okay.

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:53.880
Descend!

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:58.350
Now, let's go, my little demons!

00:08:58.350 --> 00:08:59.180
--Okay!
--Okay!

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:03.060
Let's close it together.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:04.020
No!

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:07.480
We'll close it together, <i>zura</i>.

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:08.560
I said, no!

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:10.270
We'll close it together, <i>zura</i>!

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:13.720
Please...

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.700
Okay, I'll do it.

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:20.950
I'm sorry.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:23.000
It's fine.

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:28.040
Thank you for protecting us all this time.

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:29.460
Thank you.

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:32.960
"Thank you"

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:31.570
Bye-bye.

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:42.890
What a nice sound...

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:45.940
The piano here sounds very nice.

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:48.290
I wonder if it's because
the sound echoes since it's a big room...

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:49.250
Yeah, it may be...

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:54.440
The view from here is pretty, isn't it?

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:57.860
When I transferred to 
this school, I thought...

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:01.800
...that you could never find
this kind of view in Tokyo.

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:07.820
There's something I've wanted
to tell you all this time.

00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:08.730
Hm?

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:17.170
To tell you the truth,
I love you sooooooooo much!

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:19.530
Me, too!

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:28.770
It was really a lot of fun
spending time with everyone.

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:31.020
Yep, it was.

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:42.200
Just how long are you planning
to keep looking outside?

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:43.510
I know.

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:45.570
Mari-<i>san</i>.

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:49.580
"Diploma and Certificate of Appreciation"
"Miss Mari Ohara"

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:52.080
This is <i>your</i> diploma.

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:53.770
My diploma?

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:56.590
Diploma and certificate
of appreciation. Miss Mari Ohara.

00:10:56.590 --> 00:11:00.090
This is to certify that you've
worked diligently for this school

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:02.390
as a director while still being a student.

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:07.100
Hence, to show our appreciation,
we present this certificate to you.

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:11.150
Representing all the students
at Uranohoshi Girls' High School,

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:12.350
Kanan Matsuura,

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:14.020
and Dia Kurosawa.

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:15.820
Kanan... Dia...

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:19.320
--Take it.
--Mari.

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:26.370
It's all right. The sky is connected.

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:29.160
No matter how far apart we are...
Even if we can't see each other's faces...

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:31.500
We'll be able to be together again someday.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:39.260
Thank you...

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:46.010
Goodbye.

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:52.520
And this is the last place.

00:11:58.070 --> 00:11:59.530
Because of this place...

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:02.450
...we were able to work hard all this time.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:05.030
Because of this place,
we were able to move forward.

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:07.080
The practice we did every day...

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:09.190
The fun times I had creating costumes...

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:11.260
Even when we had back aches...

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:13.500
Difficult dances...

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:17.250
Anxiety and nervousness...
It took them all in.

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:20.790
Because we had a place here
that we were able to come back to...

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.970
Well then, we'll be outside.

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:39.070
"School Idol C̶u̶l̶b̶ Club"

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:42.370
Thank you!

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:47.730
Alley-oop.

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:47.870
"School Idol C̶u̶l̶b̶ Club"

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:50.080
Oops!

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:08.220
"Ura High"

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:26.820
Chika-<i>chan</i>.

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:31.040
Chika...

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:33.420
Chika-<i>chan</i>...

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:55.060
We'll make sure our memories
of Uranohoshi are filled with smiles!

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:59.070
I won't cry! I'm not gonna cry!

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:01.610
--Chika-<i>chan</i>...
--Chika-<i>chan</i>...

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:04.190
--Let's close it...
--...together.

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:26.840
Why there?

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:30.340
I wanted it in a place
where everyone can see it...

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:34.850
So that it'll greet us
whenever we come by or return.

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:38.600
Hey! Chika! It's here!

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:40.060
"Tochiman" "Restaurant"

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:41.540
Your school uniform
for your new school came in!

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:43.610
Okay!

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:45.990
Looks like spring is here.

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:49.490
Have the third years already left?

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:50.490
Yeah.

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:55.610
Mari-<i>chan</i>, Dia-<i>chan</i>, and Kanan-<i>chan</i>...
They've all left.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:00.470
Hey, do you remember...?

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:10.010
You used to worry about
what others would think when you failed.

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:12.590
The truth was, you were frustrated,
but you covered it up

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:14.680
and pretended that you gave up.

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:19.850
It was like that with the paper plane, too.

00:15:24.320 --> 00:15:26.230
--Say...
--Yeah?

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:32.260
I found it... A shine all our own, right?

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:35.240
We found it there, right?

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:37.910
Is that really what you're thinking?

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:43.380
You're as dense as ever, Chika!

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:48.200
You can fly it as many times
as you want, Chika-<i>chan</i>!

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:54.060
After all the hard work you did,
I'm sure your answer was there somewhere.

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:59.250
That Chika who didn't give up
can definitely find what she's looking for.

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:10.570
Go!

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:15.340
Fly!

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:22.410
Go find the answer.

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:54.860
Excuse me, I'm coming in.

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:58.770
I'm Chika Takami from Year 2, Class A.

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:07.790
"Director's Office"

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:10.800
"Year 1, Class A"

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:14.320
I'm sorry.

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:20.220
Sniff, sniff. A uniform!

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:21.470
No!

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:28.480
Let go! I said let go of me!

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.600
I'm not letting go until you say yes!

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:33.830
Stop it, you two! Everyone is looking at you!

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:44.960
I want to be a school idol
with you, Hanamaru-<i>chan</i>!

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:47.750
Can I do it?

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:50.380
I'll say weird things.

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:52.760
I might do rituals and stuff sometimes.

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:55.640
I might tell you to be my little demon!

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:02.430
One, two, three, four! One, two, three, four!

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:05.100
Speed up the move there a little.

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:06.940
--Okay!
--And Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>--

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:08.130
Yohane!

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:10.440
Speed up just a tiny bit.

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:12.780
Affirmative! I'll use
my teleportation technique!

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:21.580
You're such a liar.

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:29.030
You decided that you wouldn't cry... Chika...

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:34.510
Why am I remembering those things...?

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.990
Why am I hearing those voices...?

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:41.970
Why...? Why...?

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:45.690
Roar!

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:59.580
A miracle suddenly drifted into
the everyday life of a normal girl like me.

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:02.700
I wanted to have something
I could lose myself in.

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:04.700
I wanted to have something
I could do with all my heart.

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:07.710
I wanted to have something
I could fully focus on.

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:11.740
But I didn't know what to do.

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:16.960
Then something drifted down and
blew away those simmering feelings I had.

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:18.720
It was...

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:20.470
That shine was...!

00:19:26.350 --> 00:19:27.180
Chika!

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:28.350
What took you so long?!

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:30.140
You're late again!

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:34.570
Everyone...

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:36.840
But how come...?

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:40.030
Ta-da!

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:50.620
This isn't a dream.

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:53.460
We all wanted to sing with you.

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:54.590
For the last time.

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:57.300
--At this place.
--In the promised land.

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:58.920
We've been waiting for you, <i>zura</i>.

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:00.090
Chika-<i>chan</i>!

00:20:00.470 --> 00:20:01.760
Let's sing!

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:04.820
Together!

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:08.350
Okay!

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:19.540
Together!

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:34.330
<i>We</i> <i>rushed</i> <i>toward</i> <i>our</i> <i>dreams</i>

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:37.670
<i>Our</i> <i>WONDERFUL</i> <i>STORIES</i>

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:44.840
<i>Stories</i> <i>of</i> <i>shining</i>
<i>with</i> <i>everything we've got!</i>

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:50.720
<i>We</i> <i>were</i> <i>always,</i> <i>always chasing</i>

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:56.770
<i>A future</i> <i>that</i> <i>seemed</i>
<i>within reach but never was</i>

00:20:56.770 --> 00:21:02.610
<i>That's</i> <i>why,</i> <i>that's why,</i>
<i>I was able to meet you</i>

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:08.280
<i>Thanks</i> <i>for</i> <i>being</i> <i>with me</i>

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:11.870
<i>It</i> <i>was</i> <i>frustrating to feel</i>
<i>like</i> <i>something was missing</i>

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:14.160
<i>I</i> <i>wanted</i> <i>more</i>

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:17.460
<i>It</i> <i>was</i> <i>an</i> <i>adventure</i>
<i>to find a special something</i>

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:22.380
<i>And</i> <i>when</i> <i>we arrived here,</i>
<i>we finally found it!</i>

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:25.050
<i>We'd</i> <i>had</i> <i>it</i> <i>all</i> <i>along</i>

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:28.220
<i>All of us had it</i>

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:34.310
<i>A power before the shine</i>
<i>sleeping</i> <i>in</i> <i>our</i> <i>chests awakened</i>

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:36.810
<i>We</i> <i>rushed</i> <i>toward</i> <i>our</i> <i>dreams</i>

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:40.270
<i>Our</i> <i>stories</i>

00:21:40.270 --> 00:21:44.280
<i>A</i> <i>melody flowing from all our memories</i>

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:47.280
<i>I</i> <i>can</i> <i>hear</i> <i>a</i> <i>new</i> <i>dream</i>

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:53.660
<i>Let's</i> <i>go</i> <i>again, far away, dreaming days</i>

00:21:55.250 --> 00:21:56.330
I know now...

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:59.210
The shine I've been searching for...

00:21:59.210 --> 00:22:00.960
Our own shine...

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:03.960
I struggled, struggled, and struggled...

00:22:04.340 --> 00:22:06.090
And now I finally see it!

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:09.180
It was there from the start.

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:11.330
Ever since the first time I saw it...

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:17.730
Everything we did... Every single step
we took... All the time we spent...

00:22:17.900 --> 00:22:19.990
All of that was our shine!

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:25.370
That was the shine
I was searching for this whole time!

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:28.860
<i>We</i> <i>were</i> <i>looking</i> <i>for</i> <i>the</i> <i>blue bird</i>

00:22:28.860 --> 00:22:30.570
<i>And</i> <i>we</i> <i>found it</i>

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:34.790
<i>But</i> <i>don't</i> <i>put</i> <i>it</i> <i>in a cage</i>

00:22:34.790 --> 00:22:37.750
<i>Let</i> <i>it</i> <i>fly</i> <i>freely,</i> <i>yes!!</i>

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:43.880
<i>The</i> <i>answer</i> <i>is always in my heart</i>

00:22:43.880 --> 00:22:50.260
<i>When</i> <i>I</i> <i>realized,</i> <i>there was light</i>

00:22:50.260 --> 00:22:54.470
<i>That's</i> <i>right, we'd had it all along</i>

00:22:54.470 --> 00:22:57.730
<i>All of us had it</i>

00:22:57.730 --> 00:23:03.690
<i>A power before the shine</i>
<i>sleeping</i> <i>in</i> <i>our</i> <i>chests awakened</i>

00:23:03.690 --> 00:23:06.400
<i>We</i> <i>rushed</i> <i>toward</i> <i>our</i> <i>dreams</i>

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:09.530
<i>Our stories</i>

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:13.780
<i>A</i> <i>melody flowing from all our memories</i>

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:16.660
<i>I</i> <i>can</i> <i>hear</i> <i>a</i> <i>new</i> <i>dream</i>

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:29.590
<i>They'll start again someday,</i>
<i>the</i> <i>next</i> <i>dreaming days</i>
